  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/d33NTpYkHnmSOnD6tzDD5ANzzrMXRYW0VqqmsJD7I08vxZ39euqQIZgHbAA0gos5LmdkUY2BQTfwsgUtMYJhGWSRfVqCySkW3BSnZXwqUEqDg7HHKbb8sey3aBA1G0PHOaVmIUjTlkiVJ3IRGeSBBQWtaLf45aDhCJpYaN7opDknn7jdr7CcrlFjy3Pm4YI2maAueh9O\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/76/569c70ef6bfba99c1fdebbe0c1b7a918..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日は美容室に行き、ラーメンをたべまひた</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/dQcu7QK8xpYvxtgr00JTcXD8WQnYuL4HHgQ9eRFTnXXCt3YbKNOdEEtaYCjfE44Jx1EmXHr6rot7LgsNWg1tNxwuI2tdog9nOxx3MPyGwUCFD19lUpNpyPI9rIVVt9EIfYiBqULrd7NTLCBhIG89i2D0h7ItrYQM2e3eHM47Ri2cSzU5KvwBkZdzwYCDp3kOJ8cqeNIx\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/76/0cf866948f9496bb962d4a1e88d32277..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">俺流塩ラーメンしか！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">公式のプロフィールの好きな食べ物</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">「ラーメン」にしたんですけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">最初は「らーめん」</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">にしようとしたんですよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">やっぱり萌えだし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ひらがなの方が萌えだし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">でも私にとってラーメンは、「ラーメン」</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんだなあ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">と思って</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ラーメンにしました</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">という裏話</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おわり</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">明日は朝最短！！早起きー！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/76/a56388f026b8a7292a3199eb41fd7262..gif\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
